config HAILO_PCI
	tristate "Hailo PCIe accelerator support"
	depends on PCI
	depends on FW_LOADER
	depends on DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  Build support for Hailo PCIe AI accelerators such as Hailo-8.
	  The driver exposes the accelerator over a character device and
	  loads device firmware through the kernel firmware loader.

	  If built as a module, the module will be named hailo_pci.